      "parameters": {
        "text": "# List, array, and vector inputs\n\nLists contain a variable number of values of one type: text or integers. The 1D Array Input accepts numeric values and outputs a one-dimensional NumPy array of floats. Vectors have fixed components: X and Y for 2D, plus Z for 3D.\n\nEdit the input values, then run the workflow to see each result in its connected Show Value node.\n\nThe left column demonstrates two lists and a 1D array; the right column demonstrates vectors. All connections are direct and require no conversion."
